---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Refund & Cancellation Policy · Blu Baby Show" description="Our simple 7-day refund policy for Blu Shop digital products.">
  <section class="section legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="eyebrow">Blu Baby Show</p>
      <h1>Refund &amp; Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <p class="muted">Last updated: 15 November 2026</p>

      <h2>Digital products only</h2>
      <p>Everything in the Blu Shop is a digital download (PDF soft copy). Nothing is shipped.</p>

      <h2>Refunds: 7 days, no fuss</h2>
      <p>If you are not happy with your purchase, email
        <a href="mailto:blubabyshow@gmail.com">blubabyshow@gmail.com</a> within <strong>7 days</strong> of buying,
        with the email address you used to order. We will refund you <strong>in full</strong>. No long forms, and you don't need to give a reason.</p>

      <h2>Cancellations</h2>
      <p>Because your download is delivered instantly after payment, an order can't be cancelled once it is paid.
        You can still ask for a refund within 7 days as described above.</p>

      <h2>How refunds are paid</h2>
      <p>Refunds go back to your original payment method (UPI, card or wallet) through our payment partner,
        Dodo Payments, who is the merchant of record for these orders. We approve refund requests within 2 working days;
        your bank usually shows the money within 5–10 working days after that.</p>

      <h2>Download problems</h2>
      <p>If your download link doesn't arrive or doesn't work, email us and we will send the file again first.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Blu Baby Show, Bangalore, India · <a href="mailto:blubabyshow@gmail.com">blubabyshow@gmail.com</a> · <a href="/contact">Contact page</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal { padding-top: calc(var(--nav-h) + 2rem); max-width: 720px; }
  .legal h1 { margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .legal h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; margin-top: 2rem; color: var(--blu-deep); }
  .legal a { color: var(--blu-d); text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
